#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Serve the Kestrel Shipping demo API on localhost for the website
screenshots, so every capture shows the same responses.

Usage: demo-server <port>

Answers the requests in script/screenshots/kestrel with canned JSON and a
short fixed delay, so the latency in the status bar reads like a real API.
Unknown paths get a 404.
"""

